  "content": "<h1>鞘翅傳送門修復</h1><p>修復玩家在穿著鞘翅飛行時無法使用傳送門的問題。</p><p><span><span><span><span><iframe width=\"100%\" height=\"480px\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/vwVLNgrXnIU\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></span></span></p><h2>問題</h2><p>目前沒有新的相容性問題或錯誤被回報。如有發現，請在<a href=\"https://github.com/mahmudindev/mcmod-elytraportalfix/issues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitHub</a>上回報以便修復。</p><h2>支援版本</h2><p>🟨 26.1-26.1.2 / 🟩 1.21.1 / 🟥 1.21-1.21.11 / 🟩 1.20.1 / 🟪 1.16.5 / 🟪 1.12.2</p><p>🟩 已支援<br>\n🟥 已停止支援<br>\n🟨 進行中<br>\n🟪 考慮中</p><h2>備註</h2><p>歡迎在模組包、影片、直播或類似媒體中使用。如果你喜歡這個資料包或模組，考慮在經濟上幫助我，我將非常感激。</p><p><br></p><div style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://github.com/mahmudindev\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/intergrav/devins-badges/blob/v3/assets/compact-minimal/social/github-plural_46h.png?raw=true\" alt=\"在 GitHub 上查看我\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fmahmudindev\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/intergrav/devins-badges/blob/v3/assets/compact-minimal/available/modrinth_46h.png?raw=true\" alt=\"可在 Modrinth 取得\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@oreno69\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/intergrav/devins-badges/blob/v3/assets/compact-minimal/social/youtube-singular_46h.png?raw=true\" alt=\"在 YouTube 觀看我的頻道\"></a> <a href=\"https://discord.gg/cuYgFmq3kz\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/intergrav/devins-badges/blob/v3/assets/compact-minimal/social/discord-singular_46h.png?raw=true\" alt=\"在 Discord 與我聊天\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/mahmudindes\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/intergrav/devins-badges/blob/v3/assets/compact-minimal/donate/patreon-singular_46h.png?raw=true\" alt=\"在 Patreon 上贊助我\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252foreno\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/intergrav/devins-badges/blob/v3/assets/compact-minimal/donate/kofi-singular-alt_46h.png?raw=true\" alt=\"在 Ko-fi 上贊助我\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fsaweria.co%252fmahmudindes\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/barraIhsan/devins-badges/blob/saweria/assets/compact-minimal/donate/saweria-singular_46h.png?raw=true\" alt=\"在 Saweria 上贊助我\"></a></div><p><br></p><div style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dimensionfixer\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/mahmudindev/mcmod-dimensionfixer/blob/master/common/src/main/resources/assets/dimensionfixer/icon.png?raw=true\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\" alt=\"維度修復器\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dimensionlink\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/mahmudindev/mcmod-dimensionlink/blob/master/common/src/main/resources/assets/dimensionlink/icon.png?raw=true\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\" alt=\"維度連結\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/worldportal\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/mahmudindev/mcmod-worldportal/blob/master/common/src/main/resources/assets/worldportal/icon.png?raw=true\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\" alt=\"世界傳送門\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fvanillaworld\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/mahmudindev/mcmod-vanillaworld/blob/master/common/src/main/resources/assets/vanillaworld/icon.png?raw=true\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\" alt=\"原版世界\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/morecatvariants\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/mahmudindev/mcmod-morecatvariants/blob/master/common/src/main/resources/assets/morecatvariants/icon.png?raw=true\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\" alt=\"更多貓咪種類\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/createportalintegration\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/mahmudindev/mcmod-createportalintegration/blob/master/common/src/main/resources/assets/createportalintegration/ico